sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Queue Org Admin
    participant C as Console (SPA)
    participant B as Backend API
    participant S as Socket.IO channel

    U->>C: Open Check-in modal
    C->>B: GET /api/queue/driverDirectory (queue staff)
    B-->>C: Active driver / vehicle assignments
    C-->>U: Search list (merged with current queue)

    U->>C: Select driver, vehicle, position
    C->>C: Validate with zod schema
    C->>B: POST /api/queue/manualCheckin (ids explicit)
    B-->>C: Server-issued queueNumber
    Note over C: FIFO position fixed by backend
    C->>B: GET /api/queue/status (refetch snapshot)
    B-->>C: Updated queue
    C-->>U: Entry appears in FIFO order

    Note over B,S: Realtime change from another operator or the driver app
    B->>S: queue event
    S-->>C: Event (credentials: include)
    C->>B: Invalidate + refetch affected views
    C-->>U: Board updates without manual refresh

    U->>C: Dispatch / override / remove entry
    C->>B: POST /api/queue/... (status action)
    B-->>C: New entry status
    C-->>U: Toast confirmation + refreshed board
